    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_BtlEv_Lazarov_01:BtlEv_Lazarov_01_004:d9074482",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_BtlEv_Lazarov_01",
        "key": "BtlEv_Lazarov_01_004",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_BtlEv_Lazarov_01:BtlEv_Lazarov_01_004:d9074482",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_BtlEv_Lazarov_01:BtlEv_Lazarov_01_004:d9074482",
        "jp_sha256": "e205c426478899c4736f8ef1ceaab4b75d27e5a5c046358698a169b9f684c7ba",
        "official_en_sha256": "141dd25b21a6a8c0795ea6d8d91e10ce9ecc66d55644db1fa4ad459a0229474a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ですが戦いは力のみではありません。\r\n時にはからめ手も必要。私は頭がいいのですよ！",
        "official_en": "However! Brute force alone does not win battles... A little planning goes a long way—I know this, because I...am SMART!",
        "real_en": "But battles aren't won by strength alone.\nSometimes you need trickery, too. I'm smart, you see!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
