      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "初めてあなた達と会ったのは、コロボス遺跡でしたねぇ……。\r\nあそこでは、本当に実験が捗りました。",
        "official_en": "I seem to recall that we first met at Kolobos Ruins... What a lovely little scientific staycation that was.",
        "real_en": "We first met at the Kolobos Ruins, didn't we...?\nMy experiments made wonderful progress there."
      },
